name: smart-pipette
displayName: Smart Pipette
author: m3rcur1e
version: "1.0.0"
minGameVersion: "160"
hidden: true
description: "The pipette (Pick key, middle mouse) on empty ground picks the block that works there: a plasma bore for ore in a wall, a cliff crusher for a wall, a condenser for a steam vent, a drill for ore, a pump for liquid, a core for a core zone. Click again for the next one."
